{"version":1,"content":"<p>由張智霖與吳卓羲等主演的無綫台慶劇《璀璨之城》播出以來話題不斷，有份參演的陳瀅情慾戲被指過火教壞細路，而張曦雯則自爆曾婉拒裸露戲，最終在江美儀等游說下終首肯演出，相關消息連日於網上愈炒愈熱，以訛傳訛引申出「不同版本」！</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T04:20:32.001103+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":115,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-25T09:17:55+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T04:13:25.537332+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T04:13:25.537332+00:00","content_hash":"bb2a8588ec62a232e04b0d193c62603913c97af0c1e908d4b64a9ae4d5f80131","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}